{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0302_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0302_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1d8093e899a3e1f27664e19a141547be6f1037e327d95452c37677c1d2643b4f", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、牛ですよ牛。\nのんびりしてて結構かわいいですね～！", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，是牛哦，牛。\n慢悠悠的，还挺可爱的呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
